4,924.9 下方，且仍遠低於 MA60 66,118.7。15m、5m 也收在各自 MA20、MA60 下方，MACD 柱均為負。09:00 的 1H K 線從 65,293.2 回落至 64,871.9，盤中低點觸及 64,613.2，呈現反彈後再受賣壓的短線結構。這些均線是同一價格結構的不同觀察，不重複計為多項獨立證據。\n\n**資金流、槓桿與情緒：**Binance BTCUSDC OI 近 24 小時減少 0.48%、近 4 小時增加 0.55%；OI 不辨多空，不能單憑這些變化判定有新增空方，但也沒有明確證據顯示多方資金持續擴張。資金費率 -0.0013%／8 小時、premium -0.0208%，只顯示合約略偏空，幅度有限。Hyperliquid 樣本在 64,535 附近有多單強平價帶，往下另有 64,103、63,856 的樣本帶；若價格先跌破近端支撐並伴隨實際強平成交，可能加速下行，但這是有限地址樣本，並非全市場清算預","time":"2026-11-16T09:01:20+08:00"}],"started_at":"2026-11-16T09:00:00+08:00","models":{"quick":{"provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6-luna","key":"OpenAI 槽位 5"},"deep":{"provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6-luna","key":"OpenAI 槽位 5"}},"done":5,"running_role":"bull","waiting":null,"resumed":false,"last_issue":null,"issues":[]},"paused":false,"host":{"label":"GCP","version":"1.0.82","heartbeat_at":"2026-11-16T09:01:20+08:00"},"frontend_revision":"7348fd481ccca5ae","publisher":{"active":false,"started_at":1794790854.0955448,"pending":false,"retry_attempt":4,"last_result":{"reason":"run_start","finished_at":1794790855.3971305,"pushed":false,"ok":false,"duration_s":1.3}},"market_training":{"slot":"2026-11-16T06:17:00+08:00","started_at":"2026-11-16T06:17:23.785+08:00","finished_at":"2026-11-16T06:17:31.547+08:00","state":"complete","elapsed_s":4.86,"next_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:00+08:00","horizons":{"1":{"state":"complete","version":"014ec5c91c","passed":false,"samples":4271,"elapsed_s":0.69,"candidate":{"version":"014ec5c91c","created_ms":1794781049716,"train_count":3431,"valid_count":504,"valid_from_ms":1792965600000,"valid_to_ms":1794780000000,"latest_label_ms":1794780000000,"scores":{"brier":0.25107656956490326,"drawdown":0.0928295201144338},"baseline":{"brier":0.25012979440630495,"drawdown":0.0},"previous":null,"passed":false,"variant":"raw","validation":{"version":1,"calibration_count":336,"rolling":[{"count":336,"start_ms":1789336800000,"end_ms":1790546400000,"train":{"count":2423,"start_ms":1779404400000,"end_ms":1788127200000},"calibration":{"coun